# =============================================================================
# Redirects — Netlify syntax (also understood by Cloudflare Pages).
#
# Rule of thumb: never serve the same content at two URLs. Pick the clean
# folder URL, 301 everything else to it, and keep only that URL in the sitemap
# and in your internal links.
# =============================================================================

# Not-found page (Netlify/Cloudflare serve this automatically; GitHub Pages
# uses 404.html from the site root, Apache/nginx need an ErrorDocument).
/*    /404.html    404

# ── Uncomment and edit if you ever change a URL ──────────────────────────────
# /old-page/          /new-page/            301
# /nkt-charge-hub     /nkt-charge-hub/      301   # force the trailing slash
# /index.html         /                     301
# /home/              /                     301

# ── If you move to a new domain ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# https://old-domain.com/*   https://georgesthomas.com/:splat   301
